        <mxCell id="note1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;" value="All artifacts live in .workflow/&lt;work-item&gt;/ — 01-DECISION-SPEC.md · 02-TECH-OPTIONS.md · _reviews/ · _phases/.&#xa;The orchestrator holds only paths, briefs and verdicts; heavy work runs in delegates — gates hand over path + verdicts, the artifact never enters its context.&#xa;Phase skills (spec · tech-options) are the gate contract, preloaded into every phase agent; the craft underneath is swappable (superpowers · Pocock · Osmani)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="1300" x="80" y="856" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;" value="Autopilot — today&#39;s separate autonomous path: brainstorm → engine.js (Plan → Plan review → Execute waves → Code review → Verify) → finish-branch → PR.&#xa;Its pieces become the engine&#39;s future phases." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="1080" x="1480" y="856" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
